B.a5I=s(["Appropriate KMC bed/wrap available.","Clean, comfortable, private area secured.","Documentation and monitoring chart available.","Trained healthcare provider available.","Mother/caregiver counselled.","Baby is upright or at least at 30 degrees."],t.s)
B.YD=new A.b4(B.ds,B.a2,"Ensure before starting KMC",B.a5I,B.p)
B.a9U=s(["Start KMC early in every eligible preterm or low-birth-weight baby; continue as long as possible.","Ensure correct positioning, a clear airway, and secure support; monitor temperature, breathing, and feeding.","Support exclusive breast milk feeding and counsel families to continue KMC at home with scheduled follow-up."],t.s)
