B.a4k=s(["Diarrhoeal severe dehydration: IV RL/NS 30 mL/kg in 1 h, then 70 mL/kg over 5 h (WHO Plan C).","If IV not possible: ORS 20 mL/kg/h for 6 h. Assess 1\u20132 hourly and titrate fluids.","Hypernatremic dehydration related to poor feeding/hot environment: manage as per the standard neonatal protocol."],t.s)
